WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Vast, decaying memory archive - main hall, tense.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Already here?

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Kael: They... always are. Remember?

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.900 align:center
Lyra: That shard... I need it!

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.200 align:center
Kael: A core. Don't... lose it.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500 align:center
Lyra: Closing in. Too fast!

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Vast, decaying memory archive - collapsing console, urgent.

8
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.100 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Burning!

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.400 align:center
Kael: Purpose... burning bright.

10
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.700 align:center
Lyra: Floor's going! Where next?

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000 align:center
Kael: Deeper. Always deeper.

12
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.300 align:center
Lyra: They're right behind me!

13
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.600 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Narrow, unstable passage within the archive, tense.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.900 align:center
Lyra: Walls are shifting! Traps now?

15
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.200 align:center
Kael: They learn. Adapt. Always.

16
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.500 align:center
Lyra: That flicker... it's a hunter!

17
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.800 align:center
Kael: Don't... look back.

18
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.100 align:center
Lyra: Almost through! Just hold!

19
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.400 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Labyrinthine data-corridors - deeper archive, dread.

20
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.700 align:center
Lyra: Which way? All dead ends!

21
00:00:56.1000 --> 00:00:58.1000 align:center
Kael: The paths... blur. Like me.

22
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.300 align:center
Lyra: Two of them! Flanking!

23
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.600 align:center
Kael: Their purpose... clear.

24
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:03.900 align:center
Lyra: No surrender! Never!

25
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:09.200 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Labyrinthine data-corridors - dead end, desperate.

26
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.500 align:center
Lyra: Dead end! They're here!

27
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.800 align:center
Kael: The shard... use it. Now.

28
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.100 align:center
Lyra: No! It's mine! I won't!

29
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.400 align:center
Kael: You'll... lose more.

30
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.700 align:center
Lyra: Not this one! Never this!

31
00:01:20.1000 --> 00:01:24.1000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Labyrinthine data-corridors - dead end, dread.

32
00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.300 align:center
Lyra: Agh! It hit me!

33
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.600 align:center
Kael: A fragment... gone. Who are?

34
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.900 align:center
Lyra: No... my name... what was it?

35
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.200 align:center
Kael: Lyra. Your name is Lyra.

36
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.500 align:center
Lyra: Lyra... Yes. I remember.

37
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Chamber of calcified memories, dread.

38
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.100 align:center
Lyra: What is this place? Horrifying.

39
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.400 align:center
Kael: Their 'peace.' Their 'order.'

40
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.700 align:center
Lyra: They devour... then freeze?

41
00:01:48.1000 --> 00:01:50.1000 align:center
Kael: Protecting. From chaos. From you.

42
00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.300 align:center
Lyra: Never! I won't become this!

43
00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:59.600 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Corridors leading from the calcified chamber, urgent.

44
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.900 align:center
Lyra: They're pushing me. Where?

45
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.200 align:center
Kael: The core. The nexus.

46
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.500 align:center
Lyra: They want me contained. Never!

47
00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:07.800 align:center
Kael: Resistance... futile.

48
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.100 align:center
Lyra: Not for me! Not now!

49
00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.400 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Archive's central chamber - total collapse imminent, desperate.

50
00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.700 align:center
Lyra: Too many! It's all falling!

51
00:02:17.1000 --> 00:02:19.1000 align:center
Kael: No escape. Not this time.

52
00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.300 align:center
Lyra: My blueprint... what was it for?

53
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.600 align:center
Kael: To create... to build.

54
00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.900 align:center
Lyra: Then I'll build a shield!

55
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Archive's central chamber - point of sacrifice, desperate.

56
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.500 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me... Kael!

57
00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.800 align:center
Kael: No! Not... your core!

58
00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.100 align:center
Lyra: It's my only way! Live!

59
00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.400 align:center
Kael: What remains... of you?

60
00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:41.700 align:center
Lyra: Enough. Just enough.

61
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Void within the collapsing memory-world, dread.

62
00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.300 align:center
Lyra: It's gone. My purpose...

63
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.600 align:center
Kael: A blank slate... for them.

64
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.900 align:center
Silence (Antagonist): Your next destination... is clear.

65
00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.200 align:center
Lyra: No! How do you know?

66
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.500 align:center
Silence (Antagonist): The architect's path... predictable.
